# Diagrams rendered by asciidoctor-diagram. Every other build writes them into the generated site
# instead, but dev mode has no generated site and serves this directory live, so there they still
# land here; see quarkus.asciidoc.attributes.imagesoutdir in config/application.properties. They are
# build output: the .puml sources and the inline plantuml blocks in the .adoc are what is under
# version control. Everything else in this directory is a hand-made image and is tracked as normal.
